## Population-Level Rates {#sec-pop-rates}


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
rates_rvar |>
  plot_prior_post_dens(.value, normalize = "groups") +
  labs(x = "") +
  facet_wrap(vars(.variable), scales = "free",
             labeller = labeller(.variable = \(l) str_remove(l, "log_"))) +
  NULL
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![Population-level log growth and regression rates — prior vs posterior.](parameter-inference_files/figure-html/fig-pop-rates-1.png){#fig-pop-rates width=576}
:::
:::


